Error [E3530]: Build rule code `E9000` is reserved
  --> tests/ui/build_enforce_reserved_code.jet:2:8
    |
  2 | struct Entity {
    |        ^^^^^^
 Why: Codes beginning with E or W followed only by digits belong to the compiler
 Fix: Use a project prefix such as `ORG01`
